# img-hai-smoke.pdl - fast, no remote job. From a FRESH window (placed=0): place the test tile, rotate, flip, move right. Buttons are pressed by their element id / label (relay_drive 'press'), so the test does not depend on nav numbers.
STEP | press | label:test_tile
STEP | expect | &.hq-apps/img-hai/state/ui.txt | contains | placed=1 | 5
STEP | press | rot
STEP | expect | &.hq-apps/img-hai/state/ui.txt | contains | r90 | 5
STEP | press | flip
STEP | expect | &.hq-apps/img-hai/state/ui.txt | contains | flip | 5
STEP | press | mr
STEP | expect | &.hq-apps/img-hai/state/ui.txt | contains | @2,1 | 5
STEP | shot | &.hq-apps/img-hai/state/shot_5_smoke.png
